    66	
    67	Finally, neither coordination-search span is a measured FULL-versus-neutral source effect. It cannot be inserted as the population effect of each required source contrast. Wall 2 is serious under the stated assumptions; its purported application to the actual learned effect is **UNDETERMINED**.
    68	
