The calendar arithmetic confirms 166 TRAIN dates. The original 24 used/reserved dates and the later 30-date diagnostic cover 50 distinct dates, leaving 116 uncommitted dates. The allocation is 48 evaluation dates, 116 source/development dates, and two quarantined reservations. At the measured SD, an ideal date-only calculation needs 18 dates for a predeclared +1% contrast to clear the +0.5% margin with 80% power; learner-seed variance and calibration remain separate limits.
