+
+DATEALLOC — binding delegated decision, 2026-09-10. The date-allocation question is CLOSED. This document prospectively replaces the approximately 160-date allocation in §D1 and resolves the ambiguous phrase “training on the claim panel”; it does not alter sealed files, margins, arms, physics, checkpoints, or the acceptance rule. No experiment was run.
+
+Evidence labels throughout: **Verified** means a file actually opened, distinguishing a recorded assertion from executable enforcement; **Derived** means arithmetic or a mathematical argument under explicit assumptions; **Inferred** means an adjudicative interpretation. **Decision** denotes a new rule imposed here, not a fact claimed to have existed previously.
+
