+**The exact allocation and immutable commitments**
+
+**Verified.** The frozen inventory has 373 files: 166 TRAIN, 160 TEST, 47 embargo. The erratum correctly replaces the misleading 124× comparison with 166/160 ≈ 1.04×. Independent corroboration is the frozen preregistration's split fields. The calendar rule is seven TRAIN days, one embargo, seven TEST days, one embargo from 2025-07-27, filtered by existing filenames. [C/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-ARCHIVE-AND-GROWTH-2026-09-09.md:6,41–48; W/artifacts/PREREG-FROZEN-2026-08-25-R2.json:2794–2805; W/src/mcrl/env/ephemeris.py:255–278.]
