+
+**Verified.** The old ledger has 24 identities on 22 distinct dates; adding the earlier namespace makes 24 distinct TRAIN dates. Four are claim reservations, so subtracting all 24 as spent development would be wrong. Formal role counts and the prospective replacement of rejected claim world 1 with world 5 are recorded in the stage-4h report. The date mapping is the earlier filename-based reconstruction, whose inventory explicitly says the sealed manifest bytes were absent from this checkout. [W/DATE-VARIANCE-2026-09-09.md:65–80; W/.scratch/date-variance/inventory.md:58–64,94–105; W/.scratch/multi-catfish-v025-physics-successor/V025-ENGINE-STAGE4H-REPORT-2026-09-09.md:84.]
