+Sources for every mapping: W/.scratch/date-variance/inventory.md:68–88,96–105. **Inferred conservative adjudication:** 2026-03-28 is already in the quarantined earlier namespace, and 2026-01-25 now has an opened diagnostic outcome. Neither is silently recycled into fresh confirmation. No sealed reservation is edited. [W/DATE-VARIANCE-2026-09-09.md:70,80; M/CEILING30-MARGIN-2026-09-10.md:57.]
+
+**Verified.** All 30 dates in CEILING30-MARGIN are also committed development/calibration evidence, regardless of the sign of their outcomes:
+
+`2025-07-31, 2025-08-18, 2025-09-03, 2025-09-30, 2025-10-17, 2025-11-04, 2025-11-20, 2025-12-07, 2025-12-24, 2026-01-03, 2026-01-04, 2026-01-06, 2026-01-07, 2026-01-09, 2026-01-19, 2026-01-21, 2026-01-22, 2026-01-24, 2026-01-25, 2026-02-20, 2026-03-09, 2026-03-27, 2026-04-13, 2026-04-30, 2026-05-16, 2026-06-02, 2026-06-29, 2026-07-17, 2026-08-02, 2026-08-20`.
