+**Derived allocation:** E has 48 dates, including 46 newly assigned dates. Q = {2026-01-25, 2026-03-28}. The source/development pool is exactly `S = recorded TRAIN archive \ (E ∪ Q)`, with **116** dates: 46 existing commitments plus 70 newly assigned source dates. This complement rule completely enumerates S without an arbitrary second selection. Source eligibility is not permission to repurpose sealed calibration/probe artefacts; those identities keep their roles, and any new source worlds have separate lineage.
